  "text": "AFK Corporeal Beast\n\n​\nDisclaimer\n⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S).\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work.\n​\nPositioning\n\n⬥ Place your  and stand on the tile marked above.\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Upon entering the instance,  once and stand on the tile south of the northernmost grave.\n⬥ You may get moved due to the Corporeal Beast sometimes wandering around.\n​\nMelee AFK Method (80+ kph) \nOverview\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work:\n    • Cutting corners will result in failure.\n    • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel.\n\nItems\n⬥ EoF  may be substituted for Am-Hej Amulet \n⬥ Scripture of Wen  may be substituted for Underworld Grimoire 4\nOther\n⬥ Upgraded Kinetic cyclone \n⬥ Multiple forms of poison damage \n    • Weapon poison+++ \n    • Kwuarm incense sticks  \n⬥  and  for prayer restoration\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n​\nPresets and Relics\n⬥ Melee \n\nAction Bars\n​\n\n​\nExample Kills\n⬥ Melee \n​\nNecromancy AFK Method (Outdated) \nOverview\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work:\n    • Cutting corners will result in failure.\n    • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel.\n\nItems\n⬥ Amulet of souls \n⬥ Ancient elven ritual shard \n    •  causes issues with prayer sustain from  and \n⬥ Igneous Kal-Mor  or Igneous Kal-Zuk \nAbilities\n⬥ Conjure Undead Army \n    • Customised to conjure all spirits.\nOther\n⬥ Darkness \n    • Causes issues with prayer sustain from  and \n⬥ Kinetic cyclone \n    • Ideally upgraded \n⬥ Multiple forms of poison damage \n    • Cinderbane gloves \n    • Weapon poison+++ \n    • Kwuarm incense sticks \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n​\nPresets and Relics\n⬥ Necromancy \n\n​\nAction Bars\n\n​\nExample Kills\n⬥ Necromancy \n​\n      \n    ",
  "normalizedText": "AFK Corporeal Beast ​ Disclaimer ⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S). ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work. ​ Positioning ⬥ Place your and stand on the tile marked above. ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Upon entering the instance, once and stand on the tile south of the northernmost grave. ⬥ You may get moved due to the Corporeal Beast sometimes wandering around. ​ Melee AFK Method (80+ kph) Overview ⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work: • Cutting corners will result in failure. • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel. Items ⬥ EoF may be substituted for Am-Hej Amulet ⬥ Scripture of Wen may be substituted for Underworld Grimoire 4 Other ⬥ Upgraded Kinetic cyclone ⬥ Multiple forms of poison damage • Weapon poison+++ • Kwuarm incense sticks ⬥ and for prayer restoration ​ Presets and Relics ⬥ Melee Action Bars ​ ​ Example Kills ⬥ Melee ​ Necromancy AFK Method (Outdated) Overview ⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work: • Cutting corners will result in failure. • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel. Items ⬥ Amulet of souls ⬥ Ancient elven ritual shard • causes issues with prayer sustain from and ⬥ Igneous Kal-Mor or Igneous Kal-Zuk Abilities ⬥ Conjure Undead Army • Customised to conjure all spirits. Other ⬥ Darkness • Causes issues with prayer sustain from and ⬥ Kinetic cyclone • Ideally upgraded ⬥ Multiple forms of poison damage • Cinderbane gloves • Weapon poison+++ • Kwuarm incense sticks ​ Presets and Relics ⬥ Necromancy ​ Action Bars ​ Example Kills ⬥ Necromancy ​",
